    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n33778" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἑλλᾰδάρχ-ης</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ου</span>,
			ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>president of the</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κοινὸν τῶν Ἀχαιῶν</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				4.1600
			</span></i> (Corinth, <span class="entity">ii A.D.</span>), <i><span class="en">
				<u>SIG</u>
				846.5
			</span></i> (Delph., <span class="entity">ii A.D.</span>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>official of the Delphic Amphictyony</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἑ. ἀμφικτυόνων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					4.590
				</span></i>
			 (Argos, <span class="entity">ii A.D.</span>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>official of the Greek community in the province of Galatia,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				IGRom.
				3.211
			</span></i> (Ancyra, <span class="entity">ii A.D.</span>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b> as an honorary title, <i><span class="en">
				<u>OGI</u>
				528.10
			</span></i>(<span class="entity">Prusias</span>).</div>
